msgid ""
"(Optional) If the dataset is partitioned by time, improve search "
"performance and reduce cost by defining partition filters. Datasets are "
"typically partitioned in a hierarchical manner, such as by year, month, "
"and day, so make sure the filters are arranged in the correct order. Time"
" Format requires a custom time format string."
