"Deployment clients are Splunk platform instances that a deployment server"
" manages and configures. You can group deployment clients into one or "
"more server classes. Deployment clients poll deployment servers for new "
"or updated content, then download the content and use it according to the"
" instructions specified by their server class. Content can range from "
"apps and system configurations to scripts, images, and supporting "
"material. "
